    "title": "Measles exposures reported in Phoenix, Flagstaff areas - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago Arizona health officials issued a warning on Wednesday about possible exposure to measles in three places in Phoenix and Flagstaff. One infected person was at a downtown Phoenix hotel and concert last week. A different person with the measles was at the Flagstaff mall last week. Symptoms may not appear for another two weeks. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
